WEBVTT

00:22.160 --> 00:22.760
Halt!

00:23.600 --> 00:24.559
Identify yourself.

00:24.640 --> 00:26.768
I am the wife of the Heir
to the Marquis of Shunan.

00:26.879 --> 00:27.760
Open the city gates!

00:27.760 --> 00:29.872
What is the purpose
of you leading your troops here

00:29.880 --> 00:30.736
in the dead of night?

00:31.000 --> 00:33.359
Forgive me,
but I am in armor and bound by duty.

00:33.479 --> 00:34.320
I cannot let you pass.

00:42.780 --> 00:44.079
(Rong)

00:44.079 --> 00:46.079
I am under secret orders
from Noble Consort Rong

00:46.200 --> 00:49.079
to mobilize the elite troops of
the Marquis of Shunan into the palace.

00:49.719 --> 00:51.079
If we miss the designated time,

00:51.719 --> 00:53.280
can you bear the consequences?

00:54.399 --> 00:55.679
Open the gates immediately!

00:56.016 --> 00:58.670
I will consider this your first offense
and deal with you leniently.

00:58.679 --> 00:59.840
Deal with leniently?

00:59.960 --> 01:01.039
Who do you think you are?

01:18.840 --> 01:19.359
You...

01:20.280 --> 01:20.760
You...

01:21.640 --> 01:23.239
I am the Heir to the Marquis of Shunan,

01:23.239 --> 01:24.599
Bu Shulin's twin sister.

01:24.879 --> 01:25.599
Nonsense!

01:26.599 --> 01:28.400
Since when did he have a twin sister?

01:29.159 --> 01:30.079
Xiao Wenxi,

01:30.760 --> 01:32.319
you are indeed somewhat clever.

01:32.650 --> 01:35.392
You've been pretending to be
educated, reasonable, and understanding.

01:35.520 --> 01:38.350
I only found out after receiving
a secret letter from the Crown Princess

01:38.400 --> 01:40.560
that you had
so many schemes and disguises.

01:40.656 --> 01:42.624
I don't understand
what you're talking about.

01:42.656 --> 01:44.150
You lured the tiger from the mountain,

01:44.150 --> 01:46.976
and used the token to deceive
the Bu family's troops into serving you.

01:48.200 --> 01:50.159
You intend to lead troops
into the imperial city

01:50.159 --> 01:51.879
to assist Noble Consort Rong
in her coup.

01:53.000 --> 01:54.400
If you dare to plot like this,

01:54.840 --> 01:56.760
you should have asked
if I would allow it first.

02:03.400 --> 02:04.400
What are you waiting for?

02:04.879 --> 02:06.640
Hurry and arrest this imposter!

02:08.560 --> 02:09.560
Do it!

02:10.159 --> 02:10.879
Seize her!

02:15.759 --> 02:16.360
Take her away!

02:16.520 --> 02:17.000
Move!

03:43.184 --> 03:44.030
=Blossoms of Power=

03:44.032 --> 03:47.260
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:47.260 --> 03:49.900
=Episode 35=

03:54.000 --> 03:56.352
Thank you to the Shunan Army
for your full support.

03:56.448 --> 03:57.870
You flatter us, Young Master Shen.

03:58.000 --> 03:58.800
It is our duty.

04:05.159 --> 04:06.919
I am under secret orders
from Princess Yaoxi

04:06.919 --> 04:08.400
to lead the Lanhai soldiers here.

04:08.512 --> 04:09.560
The Princess has ordered

04:09.560 --> 04:11.790
that we are entirely at your disposal,
Young Master Shen.

04:11.808 --> 04:13.710
The Crown Princess's safety
hangs by a thread.

04:13.719 --> 04:15.159
Thank you both for your full support.

04:15.280 --> 04:16.480
I am deeply grateful.

04:17.120 --> 04:18.439
Soldiers, hear my command!

04:18.464 --> 04:19.392
- Yes!
- Yes!

04:19.400 --> 04:21.270
Follow me into the palace
to protect His Majesty!

04:21.280 --> 04:23.560
Anyone who stands in my way
will be killed without mercy!

04:23.560 --> 04:24.720
- Anyone who stands in my way
- Anyone who stands in my way

04:24.720 --> 04:26.040
- will be killed without mercy!
- will be killed without mercy!

04:26.040 --> 04:26.920
Charge!

04:26.920 --> 04:30.300
- Charge!
- Charge!

04:30.300 --> 04:31.712
(Xuanming Gate)

04:31.712 --> 04:40.620
- Charge!
- Charge!

05:06.199 --> 05:06.879
Changqing,

05:08.560 --> 05:09.360
stop this.

05:11.519 --> 05:12.759
You can't keep making mistakes.

05:13.519 --> 05:14.519
Whatever I do

05:15.160 --> 05:16.399
has nothing to do with you.

05:17.879 --> 05:18.759
Get out of my way.

05:19.839 --> 05:20.480
I won't.

05:25.439 --> 05:26.240
Today,

05:26.560 --> 05:28.279
I will absolutely not let you pass.

05:29.480 --> 05:30.480
Xiao Changying,

05:30.879 --> 05:31.839
get out of my way!

05:31.839 --> 05:32.480
I won't!

05:43.959 --> 05:45.480
I'm warning you for the last time.

05:46.279 --> 05:47.839
Do not interfere in anything.

05:54.399 --> 05:55.120
Changqing,

05:57.240 --> 05:58.079
do you know?

06:00.319 --> 06:01.439
In my heart,

06:02.464 --> 06:04.830
you are more important
than anything else in this world.

06:06.160 --> 06:08.240
Others envy me for being born
into the royal family

06:09.040 --> 06:10.920
and being able to grow up so carefree.

06:12.079 --> 06:13.000
But I know

06:14.639 --> 06:16.439
it's because I have
a strong older brother

06:16.439 --> 06:18.040
who holds up the sky for me.

06:27.560 --> 06:28.879
I once made two promises.

06:30.720 --> 06:31.959
One was for Xihe.

06:33.399 --> 06:34.199
Today,

06:35.399 --> 06:36.639
I would rather die

06:38.800 --> 06:40.079
than fail to keep her safe.

06:42.319 --> 06:43.439
The second was for you.

06:44.240 --> 06:45.480
In this life,

06:46.079 --> 06:47.639
you and I are bound by blood.

06:47.639 --> 06:48.800
I will never abandon you.

06:50.000 --> 06:50.959
But now,

06:51.639 --> 06:52.959
if you take one wrong step,

06:53.216 --> 06:54.928
you will be doomed beyond redemption.

06:55.240 --> 06:57.199
I don't want
to see you end up like that.

06:57.639 --> 06:58.319
Changqing,

06:59.408 --> 07:00.680
let us bring this to an end

07:01.480 --> 07:02.759
right here!

07:13.639 --> 07:14.399
Changying!

07:32.800 --> 07:33.399
Guards,

07:34.040 --> 07:35.199
throw him in the dungeon.

07:35.199 --> 07:35.800
- Yes!
- Yes!

07:40.800 --> 07:41.560
Changqing.

07:42.399 --> 07:43.240
Changqing,

07:43.759 --> 07:44.800
you can't go!

07:46.120 --> 07:47.199
Changqing,

07:47.199 --> 07:48.480
you can't go!

07:48.639 --> 07:50.240
Xiao Changqing!

07:52.680 --> 07:54.360
You can't!

07:55.040 --> 07:56.639
Xiao Changqing!

07:58.319 --> 08:00.399
Xiao Changqing!

08:56.279 --> 08:56.960
Mother.

08:58.279 --> 08:59.039
Qing,

08:59.360 --> 09:00.240
are you all right?

09:00.528 --> 09:02.528
What is the meaning of this, Prince Xin?

09:07.960 --> 09:09.320
Do you really think

09:10.144 --> 09:11.760
you still have a chance of winning?

09:12.039 --> 09:13.240
Until the very last moment,

09:14.000 --> 09:15.200
how can the winner be decided?

09:23.039 --> 09:24.120
Hand over the edict.

09:24.799 --> 09:25.559
In your dreams.

09:26.480 --> 09:27.679
Do you really think

09:29.039 --> 09:31.080
I would yield the throne to a child?

09:32.240 --> 09:33.240
In today's battle,

09:33.759 --> 09:34.759
I will not back down.

09:35.240 --> 09:35.879
Fine.

09:38.320 --> 09:39.320
Today, except for you,

09:40.480 --> 09:42.039
everyone else will die here.

09:44.399 --> 09:45.080
Guards!

10:25.240 --> 10:27.000
Attack!

10:27.000 --> 10:33.120
- Attack!
- Attack!

10:33.360 --> 10:34.639
Report!

10:36.320 --> 10:38.519
Your Highness,
the Shunan Army has entered the palace!

10:38.799 --> 10:40.440
The Northwest Army and the Lanhai Army

10:40.639 --> 10:41.519
have also broken in!

10:43.320 --> 10:43.879
No.

10:44.720 --> 10:45.440
Impossible.

10:47.759 --> 10:48.360
You...

10:49.000 --> 10:50.720
How did you send the message out?

10:52.980 --> 10:56.020
(The Great Buddha Hall)

11:10.380 --> 11:11.620
(Order)

11:18.176 --> 11:20.000
(Prince Xin harbors
treasonous intentions.)

11:20.064 --> 11:22.360
(Quickly summon Shen Yun'an,
Heir of the Duke of Wei, to the capital)

11:22.360 --> 11:23.424
(to prepare for any contingencies.)

11:25.536 --> 11:27.720
Besides His Majesty,
who else is in the bedchamber?

11:27.840 --> 11:29.120
To answer Your Highness,

11:29.140 --> 11:31.072
the Directorate of Astronomy,
the Chief Minister,

11:31.104 --> 11:33.480
and several officials
from the Ministry of Rites are present.

11:33.600 --> 11:35.080
They all entered by imperial decree.

11:35.152 --> 11:38.432
The Assistant Directorate of Astronomy
and Vice Minister of Rites are waiting.

11:38.496 --> 11:41.456
I happen to have some questions
for the Vice Minister of Rites.

11:41.759 --> 11:43.039
Before seeing His Majesty,

11:43.039 --> 11:44.399
may I have a word with him?

11:44.416 --> 11:45.456
Yes, Your Highness.

11:46.919 --> 11:48.639
I, Wu Shan, Vice Minister of Rites,

11:48.720 --> 11:50.080
greet Your Highness.

11:51.039 --> 11:53.360
(Wu Shan, Vice Minister of Rites)
May I ask why you

11:53.360 --> 11:54.159
summoned me today?

11:54.224 --> 11:56.550
I have a matter that requires you
to brave danger alone.

11:56.630 --> 11:58.096
This matter is of utmost importance.

11:58.120 --> 11:59.799
Are you willing to lend me a hand?

12:01.000 --> 12:02.240
You may not know,

12:02.679 --> 12:04.519
but the Crown Prince
previously instructed

12:04.768 --> 12:07.504
that seeing the Crown Princess
is like seeing the Crown Prince himself.

12:08.399 --> 12:09.039
Back then,

12:09.248 --> 12:11.216
if the Crown Prince
hadn't overcome all objections

12:11.248 --> 12:13.030
to appoint scholars
from humble backgrounds,

12:13.279 --> 12:14.600
I would never be where I am today.

12:15.200 --> 12:16.660
Furthermore, we from humble families

12:16.688 --> 12:19.200
all rely on His Highness's grace
in promoting the underprivileged

12:19.200 --> 12:20.592
and appointing only the virtuous.

12:21.039 --> 12:23.080
Only then could
our lifelong ambitions be realized.

12:24.360 --> 12:25.720
A scholar dies for his confidant.

12:26.559 --> 12:28.679
The task you entrust to me,

12:28.960 --> 12:31.600
I will not decline
even if it means my death.

12:33.000 --> 12:33.519
Good.

12:34.304 --> 12:36.940
My brother is waiting at Mount Ziyun
in the suburbs of the capital.

12:36.960 --> 12:38.080
Go there personally

12:38.090 --> 12:40.030
and tell him to immediately
contact Young Master Bu

12:40.039 --> 12:41.290
and Consort Shu's personal guards

12:41.300 --> 12:43.280
to enter the palace at once
to protect the Emperor.

12:43.984 --> 12:46.080
The city is heavily guarded
inside and out right now.

12:46.224 --> 12:47.840
The road ahead is extremely dangerous.

12:48.010 --> 12:49.536
I'll leave this to you, Minister Wu.

12:50.080 --> 12:51.960
I am familiar with the trails
in the suburbs.

12:52.279 --> 12:54.159
I will definitely not fail this mission.

12:54.320 --> 12:56.600
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

13:03.440 --> 13:04.720
You had already planned

13:06.080 --> 13:07.159
to fight me to the death.

13:08.519 --> 13:09.600
You could have

13:10.080 --> 13:11.320
avoided coming to this.

13:35.639 --> 13:36.360
Xihe!

13:38.960 --> 13:39.399
Let's go.

13:46.720 --> 13:47.919
Get down! Don't move!

13:55.728 --> 13:57.000
The palace is under control!

13:57.000 --> 13:58.519
None of the rebels will escape!

14:01.360 --> 14:02.440
Good work, Yun'an!

14:02.679 --> 14:05.519
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

14:05.519 --> 14:07.039
- We, the soldiers of the three armies,
- We, the soldiers of the three armies,

14:07.039 --> 14:08.799
- will follow Your Highness's orders!
- will follow Your Highness's orders!

14:08.799 --> 14:10.039
- We await your command!
- We await your command!

14:10.039 --> 14:11.759
- We will follow Your Highness's orders!
- We will follow Your Highness's orders!

14:11.759 --> 14:13.000
- We await your command!
- We await your command!

14:13.000 --> 14:13.960
Please rise, everyone.

14:14.000 --> 14:15.780
- Yes, Your Highness!
- Yes, Your Highness!

14:27.919 --> 14:29.039
Rebels of the Rong family,

14:29.600 --> 14:30.600
your cause is lost.

14:30.992 --> 14:32.270
Putting up a stubborn resistance

14:32.440 --> 14:33.639
will only lead to your deaths.

14:34.679 --> 14:35.679
Considering that you

14:36.039 --> 14:37.720
may have been coerced,

14:39.039 --> 14:40.480
lay down your weapons immediately,

14:41.039 --> 14:42.600
and your families' lives will be spared.

14:43.639 --> 14:44.919
If you remain obstinate,

14:45.720 --> 14:47.159
the Embroidered Envoy is here.

14:48.016 --> 14:49.390
You will be killed without mercy.

14:52.080 --> 14:54.080
We were all forced by
Noble Consort Rong!

14:54.240 --> 14:55.200
We surrender!

14:55.200 --> 14:56.519
- We surrender!
- We surrender!

15:05.879 --> 15:06.639
Qing.

15:08.200 --> 15:09.759
Qing, stop.

15:10.399 --> 15:12.080
We have completely lost.

15:15.159 --> 15:16.799
I beg you.

15:23.559 --> 15:24.679
I beg you.

15:32.960 --> 15:34.159
I beg you.

15:46.039 --> 15:46.799
Mother.

15:53.879 --> 15:55.240
I have failed you.

16:08.960 --> 16:09.879
Qing!

16:11.039 --> 16:12.000
Qing!

16:12.720 --> 16:14.919
Qing!

16:49.240 --> 16:49.840
Take him away.

17:22.740 --> 17:32.140
(Qing)

17:49.319 --> 17:50.240
I have something

17:52.599 --> 17:54.400
to say to the Crown Princess alone.

18:19.360 --> 18:20.550
What do you want to say?

18:24.880 --> 18:26.279
I know your capabilities.

18:28.319 --> 18:29.400
As long as you want to,

18:31.519 --> 18:33.640
you can rule as the Empress Dowager.

18:35.559 --> 18:37.240
But for a woman to rule the world,

18:40.240 --> 18:41.240
this path

18:43.759 --> 18:45.240
will be very difficult for you.

18:48.359 --> 18:49.319
Now,

18:50.480 --> 18:52.400
you have saved the officials
from the sword.

18:53.000 --> 18:53.759
From now on,

18:55.519 --> 18:56.920
no matter what you want to do,

19:00.160 --> 19:02.000
no one will dare
to say a word against it.

19:03.759 --> 19:04.799
Are you saying

19:05.599 --> 19:06.440
that all of this,

19:07.799 --> 19:08.880
from forcing me to marry you

19:09.720 --> 19:11.319
to us crossing swords,

19:12.839 --> 19:14.160
was done by you on purpose?

19:19.599 --> 19:20.720
Between you and me,

19:21.359 --> 19:22.799
we were destined to be incompatible.

19:24.359 --> 19:25.759
Your biggest obstacle

19:27.440 --> 19:28.799
was me, Xiao Changqing.

19:32.480 --> 19:33.400
But now,

19:36.319 --> 19:38.039
I am a treasonous rebel.

19:41.119 --> 19:42.480
All your obstacles

19:44.400 --> 19:45.640
will cease to exist.

20:02.700 --> 20:04.100
I'll go get an imperial physician.

20:04.119 --> 20:04.799
Don't.

20:09.160 --> 20:11.119
In the last moments of my life,

20:14.599 --> 20:16.200
I want to look at you.

20:21.000 --> 20:22.359
I told you a long time ago

20:24.960 --> 20:26.480
that I could face it myself.

20:28.319 --> 20:29.880
Why did it have to come to this?

20:33.079 --> 20:34.839
I know my own heart very well.

20:39.720 --> 20:41.200
As long as I am alive,

20:45.720 --> 20:47.640
I can't let you go.

20:49.799 --> 20:51.960
I can't stop myself
from getting close to you.

20:57.440 --> 20:58.640
My existence,

21:01.319 --> 21:02.680
and my obsession,

21:05.359 --> 21:07.279
will eventually become your shackles.

21:11.160 --> 21:12.599
Only if I die

21:16.359 --> 21:18.400
can we both be free.

21:18.400 --> 21:23.340
♪The stars are sinking
like a sunken vow♪

21:23.780 --> 21:26.540
♪You drifted away alone♪

21:26.540 --> 21:31.380
♪Without a single word of goodbye♪

21:32.420 --> 21:35.060
♪Leaving no room to turn back♪

21:36.039 --> 21:37.720
I once promised

21:40.599 --> 21:42.759
that I could give up everything for you,

21:43.319 --> 21:44.759
and protect you with my life.

21:46.799 --> 21:47.720
Last time,

21:50.319 --> 21:51.480
I failed to do so.

21:54.359 --> 21:55.480
But this time,

22:00.359 --> 22:02.440
I finally didn't let you down.

22:04.220 --> 22:06.580
♪Where water and sky whisper as one♪

22:06.580 --> 22:10.380
♪Life and death are but a moment apart♪

22:11.620 --> 22:14.260
♪Let fate scheme and pull the strings♪

22:14.620 --> 22:16.980
♪Grudges will find their own end♪

22:16.980 --> 22:21.540
♪The human heart is harder
to read than any chessboard♪

22:22.180 --> 22:24.940
♪I step onto this winding path♪

22:24.940 --> 22:27.500
♪What was swept away?♪

22:29.440 --> 22:31.039
Could you... Could you

22:31.799 --> 22:33.440
grant a dying person

22:35.200 --> 22:36.359
one last wish?

22:37.599 --> 22:38.400
Please?

22:39.160 --> 22:40.680
Answer me one question.

22:42.319 --> 22:43.079
Tell me.

22:46.720 --> 22:48.680
Are you Gu Qingzhi?

22:50.680 --> 22:51.839
Are you?

22:52.300 --> 22:55.340
♪You drifted away alone♪

22:56.020 --> 23:00.140
♪Without a single word of goodbye♪

23:01.540 --> 23:03.820
♪Leaving no room to turn back♪

23:03.820 --> 23:07.940
♪I can only stay there forever♪

23:07.940 --> 23:13.220
♪In the coming years, I'll always
remember that year, my graceful lover♪

23:13.500 --> 23:15.580
♪Love hangs on the crest of the waves♪

23:16.519 --> 23:17.759
The day I first met you,

23:21.039 --> 23:22.680
it was raining like this, too.

23:41.460 --> 23:46.460
♪All farewells are stranded
in the middle of the night♪

23:47.079 --> 23:48.160
That's nice.

23:53.839 --> 23:55.240
That's nice.

23:55.900 --> 24:01.100
♪Not enough to move heaven and earth♪

24:01.100 --> 24:04.220
♪A lifetime feels too short♪

24:04.220 --> 24:07.940
♪Watching the vast sea of flowers
scattered like stars♪

24:07.940 --> 24:13.340
♪While I stand on this shore,
wrapped in memories♪

24:13.780 --> 24:16.380
♪A hand I cannot touch♪

24:16.380 --> 24:21.060
♪I hold it for a moment
in the reflection♪

24:23.780 --> 24:26.340
♪A hand I cannot touch♪

24:26.340 --> 24:29.140
♪I hold it for a moment♪

24:30.260 --> 24:35.020
♪In the reflection♪♪

25:02.980 --> 25:04.660
(Chenning Hall)

25:15.839 --> 25:16.680
Your Majesty.

25:22.200 --> 25:23.039
Your Majesty.

25:24.759 --> 25:25.720
Your Majesty.

25:27.559 --> 25:28.720
Just now,

25:28.920 --> 25:31.039
the Crown Prince
you single-handedly groomed

25:31.519 --> 25:33.200
attempted to rebel.

25:33.759 --> 25:34.920
Impossible.

25:35.880 --> 25:37.000
Changqing

25:37.480 --> 25:40.160
would never commit treason.

25:42.960 --> 25:44.839
He has already been executed.

25:45.480 --> 25:47.480
Anyone who dares to usurp the throne

25:48.559 --> 25:49.920
will meet this end.

25:52.680 --> 25:55.480
Your sons are leaving you one by one.

25:57.400 --> 25:59.079
Does it break your heart?

25:59.319 --> 26:00.319
Mother,

26:01.160 --> 26:03.279
why did you do this?

26:08.519 --> 26:10.720
Your Highness, you have been waiting
for this moment,

26:11.200 --> 26:11.759
haven't you?

26:15.640 --> 26:16.400
Yes.

26:18.039 --> 26:18.920
For this day,

26:21.400 --> 26:23.920
I have waited for over twenty years.

26:24.920 --> 26:26.119
And it's because of you

26:26.519 --> 26:28.279
that I fell short at the last hurdle.

26:30.440 --> 26:31.599
When did you

26:32.839 --> 26:34.400
start suspecting me?

26:35.079 --> 26:37.519
Gu Qingshu was just a helpless orphan.

26:38.839 --> 26:40.720
Those risky schemes

26:40.920 --> 26:42.319
must have had someone backing them.

26:43.072 --> 26:44.830
The person
of the highest status around her

26:45.119 --> 26:46.039
was you.

26:46.559 --> 26:47.599
More importantly,

26:48.240 --> 26:50.400
the poisonous incense she hid
in my golden lock

26:51.400 --> 26:52.160
was made

26:52.224 --> 26:54.544
by modifying a rare incense
from the Western Regions.

26:55.240 --> 26:56.519
The base of that incense formula

26:56.519 --> 26:58.359
was the calming incense
you frequently use.

26:58.839 --> 27:00.559
It is unique in the palace.

27:05.376 --> 27:06.640
Thinking about it carefully,

27:07.160 --> 27:09.480
why would Gu Qingshu dare
to instigate the Second Prince

27:09.480 --> 27:10.599
to oppose the East Palace?

27:10.848 --> 27:13.640
How did the Fourth Prince secretly
enter the palace to assassinate?

27:14.016 --> 27:15.980
How could he incite
the Imperial Guard to rebel?

27:16.400 --> 27:18.559
And the deaths of Consort Liang
and the Second Prince.

27:19.640 --> 27:20.799
Every single incident

27:21.000 --> 27:22.319
is connected to you.

27:23.960 --> 27:25.039
Mother,

27:27.880 --> 27:29.880
why did you do this?

27:31.440 --> 27:32.000
Because...

27:33.920 --> 27:35.559
Because I am full of hate.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.160
Did you know

27:40.144 --> 27:42.550
that the Crown Prince always
respected his grandmother?

27:42.720 --> 27:43.680
In his heart,

27:44.119 --> 27:45.160
besides His Majesty,

27:45.359 --> 27:46.640
you were his closest family.

27:46.640 --> 27:48.160
He never once suspected

27:48.599 --> 27:49.839
that you would poison him.

27:50.200 --> 27:51.759
The poison given to Huayong

27:52.519 --> 27:53.880
was your doing?

27:54.279 --> 27:54.960
Yes.

27:55.559 --> 27:56.680
Who asked him to be

27:57.440 --> 27:59.319
the Emperor's most favored son?

28:08.319 --> 28:09.119
Back then,

28:10.960 --> 28:12.759
you stood on the city wall

28:13.376 --> 28:15.110
and refused to send reinforcements,

28:15.599 --> 28:17.559
watching helplessly as Prince Qian,

28:17.759 --> 28:19.240
my own biological son,

28:20.079 --> 28:21.319
fought a lone battle

28:22.359 --> 28:23.799
and died on the battlefield.

28:26.119 --> 28:27.440
It's been twenty years.

28:28.599 --> 28:30.920
Not a day goes by
that I don't think of him.

28:31.519 --> 28:34.240
I also know Huayong is innocent.

28:34.680 --> 28:36.200
I couldn't bear it either.

28:37.079 --> 28:39.920
But whenever I think of my son
who died unjustly,

28:40.559 --> 28:42.759
my heart breaks.

28:42.759 --> 28:43.960
Mother...

28:44.359 --> 28:46.799
Huayong is not my flesh and blood.

28:48.200 --> 28:50.440
He is Juewei's own flesh and blood.

28:52.640 --> 28:54.480
He is your own grandson.

28:57.599 --> 29:00.640
Before Prince Qian died for his country,

29:01.200 --> 29:02.759
he entrusted me with this.

29:03.504 --> 29:05.400
Tomorrow,
the enemy's main force will attack.

29:05.520 --> 29:07.216
I will lead the troops out of the city.

29:07.744 --> 29:08.920
You will defend the city.

29:09.480 --> 29:10.759
Remember our agreement.

29:11.720 --> 29:13.119
One signal means come to my aid.

29:13.480 --> 29:14.200
Two signals

29:14.672 --> 29:15.920
mean defend to the death.

29:17.279 --> 29:18.279
This is a military order.

29:19.680 --> 29:21.160
I will not fail you.

29:25.680 --> 29:26.480
It's the signal.

29:26.960 --> 29:28.039
It's my brother's signal.

29:28.128 --> 29:29.680
Gather the troops and open the gates!

29:29.680 --> 29:30.359
Ride to Prince Qian's aid!

29:30.360 --> 29:31.056
- Wait!
- Yes!

29:33.720 --> 29:34.319
Hurry!

29:34.319 --> 29:34.799
Hold on.

29:38.440 --> 29:39.319
Two signals.

29:44.319 --> 29:45.599
How could it be two signals?

30:13.920 --> 30:15.440
Pass on my order.

30:19.640 --> 30:21.440
All soldiers

30:23.079 --> 30:25.160
defend the city to the death!

30:25.359 --> 30:26.200
What are you saying?

30:26.200 --> 30:27.119
- Duke Ying!
- Duke Ying!

30:27.119 --> 30:27.860
Don't be impulsive.

30:27.872 --> 30:29.440
Prince Qian is surrounded right now!

30:29.440 --> 30:30.920
Are we just going to leave him to die?

30:32.440 --> 30:34.200
Archers, nock your arrows!

30:36.000 --> 30:36.960
The city gates

30:40.160 --> 30:44.319
must never be opened!

30:44.440 --> 30:46.359
Are you going to watch Prince Qian

30:46.384 --> 30:48.304
die on the battlefield
with your own eyes?

30:48.880 --> 30:50.559
He is your brother!

30:50.720 --> 30:52.200
Your brother!

31:04.559 --> 31:08.079
This is a life-and-death pact
between my brother and me.

31:11.279 --> 31:13.759
Anyone who opens the gates
without authorization

31:14.759 --> 31:16.079
will be executed without mercy!

32:28.359 --> 32:29.119
Juewei.

32:31.160 --> 32:31.920
Juewei.

32:32.279 --> 32:32.920
Juewei.

32:41.559 --> 32:42.319
Juechong.

32:44.079 --> 32:45.119
Yunzhou City

32:45.392 --> 32:47.240
is the strategic chokepoint
of the northwest.

32:48.559 --> 32:50.440
You must hold it.

32:51.200 --> 32:53.960
You must never
let the people fall into misery.

32:57.720 --> 32:59.440
But you are the future Crown Prince.

32:59.968 --> 33:01.740
You need to return
to the imperial capital.

33:01.839 --> 33:03.319
You cannot die here.

33:04.640 --> 33:05.880
Trading my life

33:08.079 --> 33:10.599
for a shred of the people's trust
in the court

33:12.720 --> 33:14.799
and a shred of hope for the future.

33:16.799 --> 33:18.240
If I die here,

33:19.680 --> 33:21.559
it will be a worthy death.

33:22.680 --> 33:24.359
Juewei, you have the people
in your heart.

33:25.920 --> 33:26.839
But I

33:27.799 --> 33:29.039
only have you in my heart.

33:30.880 --> 33:31.920
When I was young,

33:33.359 --> 33:34.400
in the palace,

33:35.160 --> 33:36.960
I was an insignificant person.

33:38.720 --> 33:39.640
Only you

33:40.759 --> 33:42.599
noticed the emptiness in my heart,

33:44.599 --> 33:46.119
and gave me dignity.

33:48.400 --> 33:50.279
All that I could do for you

33:53.359 --> 33:55.519
was just provide you
with material things

33:56.910 --> 33:58.285
and keep up your appearances

33:59.599 --> 34:01.039
just like me.

34:04.599 --> 34:05.960
But this one time,

34:08.079 --> 34:10.000
I don't want you

34:12.559 --> 34:13.920
to be like me.

34:15.159 --> 34:15.760
No.

34:16.599 --> 34:18.159
No, Juewei.

34:18.159 --> 34:19.599
Live on well.

34:21.280 --> 34:21.760
No.

34:23.079 --> 34:24.679
Juewei, you have to hold on.

34:25.400 --> 34:27.239
You have to hold on!

34:27.239 --> 34:28.320
My wife

34:28.880 --> 34:30.440
is about to give birth.

34:31.920 --> 34:32.800
Take good care

34:35.239 --> 34:36.679
of her and the child.

34:41.679 --> 34:42.519
Juewei.

34:48.159 --> 34:48.840
Juewei.

34:53.280 --> 34:53.880
Juewei.

35:02.440 --> 35:06.000
Juewei!

35:48.000 --> 35:48.800
I...

35:49.199 --> 35:51.119
I deserve to die a thousand deaths.

35:55.159 --> 35:56.280
Sister-in-law...

35:57.719 --> 35:59.000
What happened to her?

35:59.000 --> 35:59.936
The Princess Consort

36:01.199 --> 36:03.880
heard of Prince Qian's passing

36:04.440 --> 36:05.719
and was overcome with grief.

36:05.840 --> 36:07.039
It affected her pregnancy.

36:07.360 --> 36:09.000
The bleeding wouldn't stop.

36:09.760 --> 36:10.519
Just now,

36:11.000 --> 36:12.159
she passed away.

36:24.079 --> 36:24.960
Sister-in-law,

36:28.119 --> 36:29.440
I am useless.

36:33.119 --> 36:35.360
I couldn't bring my brother back.

36:37.599 --> 36:38.400
Your Highness.

37:06.039 --> 37:06.800
Your Highness.

37:07.120 --> 37:08.920
The little imperial grandson
has been born.

37:09.000 --> 37:10.519
Should we send a message immediately

37:10.719 --> 37:12.119
to inform the Empress?

38:20.360 --> 38:23.199
Princess Consort Qian has passed away.

38:24.280 --> 38:26.400
The unborn child could not be saved.

38:28.079 --> 38:29.000
Both mother and child

38:30.960 --> 38:31.960
have perished.

38:34.840 --> 38:35.719
But Your Highness,

38:35.720 --> 38:37.600
- the imperial grandson is clearly...
- I said,

38:38.000 --> 38:39.800
both mother and child have perished.

38:42.960 --> 38:43.639
Your Highness.

38:50.880 --> 38:51.679
Guards.

38:54.720 --> 38:56.048
Here, Your Highness.

38:58.559 --> 38:59.920
These people in the room

39:00.576 --> 39:02.550
disrespected
the Princess Consort's remains

39:02.670 --> 39:03.952
and harbored malicious intent.

39:05.519 --> 39:06.800
Dispose of them cleanly.

39:07.639 --> 39:08.599
Leave no trace.

39:09.400 --> 39:09.920
Understood.

39:16.400 --> 39:18.360
- Your Highness!
- Spare us, Your Highness!

39:24.639 --> 39:25.840
From now on,

39:26.400 --> 39:27.920
you are my child.

39:50.400 --> 39:55.360
- Long live, Your Majesty.
- Long live, Your Majesty.

39:55.370 --> 39:57.490
Official Zhao brought a package
from outside the palace.

39:57.504 --> 39:59.248
He insisted it be handed
to you in person.

40:00.360 --> 40:02.199
I'm really curious.

40:02.199 --> 40:04.880
What kind of person was my father?

40:04.960 --> 40:06.360
Your father,

40:06.400 --> 40:07.719
in my heart,

40:07.719 --> 40:08.960
was a perfect man.

40:12.470 --> 40:15.410
♪I've hidden so many words♪

40:16.030 --> 40:18.830
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

40:19.700 --> 40:26.670
♪So never uncover♪

40:26.860 --> 40:29.220
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

40:30.350 --> 40:33.080
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

40:34.040 --> 40:39.380
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

40:41.140 --> 40:43.960
♪Every answer I gave♪

40:44.760 --> 40:47.610
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

40:48.400 --> 40:51.770
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

40:52.030 --> 40:55.340
♪How hard it truly was?♪

40:58.310 --> 41:01.750
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

41:02.740 --> 41:05.070
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

41:06.340 --> 41:12.100
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

41:13.510 --> 41:16.640
♪It's a shame I never could♪

41:17.090 --> 41:20.100
♪Give you a moon in return♪

41:20.210 --> 41:26.850
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

41:26.850 --> 41:30.520
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

41:31.390 --> 41:34.150
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

41:34.590 --> 41:37.720
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

41:38.160 --> 41:44.110
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

41:45.510 --> 41:49.060
♪You'll never♪

41:49.340 --> 41:58.810
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

42:24.980 --> 42:28.460
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
